* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Squad: union merge for append-only team state files
# NOTE: rules for .squad/agents/*/history.md, .squad/rai/audit-trail.md, and
# .squad/fact-checker/audit-trail.md were removed because those paths are
# backend-owned mutable state migrated out of the tracked tree (see the
# MUTABLE_SQUAD_STATE_DELETION_ALLOWLIST in scripts/pre-commit-checks.mjs).
# .squad/log/** and .squad/orchestration-log/** are intentionally left as
# tracked+union-merge here; their migration is pending a separate explicit
# go-ahead and is out of scope for this change.
.squad/log/** merge=union
.squad/orchestration-log/** merge=union
